OL,3,ARussell Brand is a 'sexual predator who
OL,4,Ahas no remorse', victim tells
OL,5,Asentencing hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn total, he faced seven charges: three
OL,8,Fof rape, three of sexual assault and
OL,9,Fone of attempted indecent assault. He
OL,10,Fwas found not guilty on three counts
OL,12,FBrand's crimes took place between 2004
OL,13,Fand 2009, and related to four women.
OL,14,FThey are all entitled to lifelong
OL,15,Fanonymity
